docs/research-notes/mechanic-conditioned-reinduction-trigger-2026-06-22.md.

- Auto-fitting nav world model (python/carnot/agentic/arc_nav_world_model.py:InducedNavWorldModel):
  learns displacement/avatar/wall/floor/goal FROM TRANSITIONS, no hardcoding (review SURVIVES:
  colour-permutation-invariant, seed-stable, tu93 L1 100% movement acc in/out-of-sample). Unit test
  tests/python/test_arc_nav_world_model.py (4 pass). Re-induction = re-fit at the new level.
